---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Refund policy — Rakhi Battle 2026" noindex>
  <article class="shell legal">
    <h1>Refund policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: 24 August 2026.</p>
    <h2>Digital products</h2>
    <p>Because paid upgrades are delivered digitally and become available immediately after verified payment, completed and successfully delivered purchases are ordinarily non-refundable.</p>
    <h2>Duplicate charge or failed delivery</h2>
    <p>If you are charged more than once for the same battle, or a verified payment does not unlock the purchased content, submit a <a href="/contact">support request</a> within 7 days. Include the battle code and payment reference. After verification, an eligible refund will be sent to the original payment method; bank or provider processing time may apply.</p>
    <h2>Safety</h2>
    <p>Never send a UPI PIN, OTP, full card number or online-banking password. We do not need these to investigate a payment.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
